{"nodes": [{"id": "plans_2026_09_05_phase_1_remaining_slices_doc", "label": "Phase 1 \u2014 The Remaining Slices, Re-Cut", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/plans/2026-09-05-phase-1-remaining-slices.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Slices 1-3b built ingest but not a system anyone can use: the web UI is a single read-only page and putting a file in means dropping it in a mounted folder and curling the worker, because the Caddyfile proxies only to api:8080. Carries a 2026-09-06 amendment that leaves the original table intact \u2014 it is the evidence for why the re-cut happened, and rewriting it would destroy the record."}, {"id": "plans_2026_09_05_phase_1_remaining_slices_usable_at_slice_5", "label": "Usable at Slice 5", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/plans/2026-09-05-phase-1-remaining-slices.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The re-cut adds and drops nothing from ROADMAP.md's Phase 1 bullets; it moves only where the slice boundaries fall, so a usable storage-and-display system arrives at the end of slice 5 rather than at the end of the phase. part_image moves out of slice 4 because it is UI work and keeping it there made slice 4 two slices wearing one coat."}, {"id": "plans_2026_09_05_phase_1_remaining_slices_cold_tier_deferred", "label": "zstd Cold Tier Deferred", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/plans/2026-09-05-phase-1-remaining-slices.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Measured on 143 MB of the real corpus: zstd -19 costs 38x the compression CPU of -3 for four percentage points. DATA.md's 6-10x estimate is for STEP, which is text; its own binary-STL estimate of ~2-2.5x is what the measurement confirms. Decompression is level-independent and effectively free, so no 'decompressing' indicator is needed either. The cold tier waits for Phase 2's STEP, where it may pay."}, {"id": "plans_2026_09_05_phase_1_remaining_slices_phase_1_exit_criterion", "label": "Phase 1 Exit Criterion", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/plans/2026-09-05-phase-1-remaining-slices.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Drop a folder of 1,000 STLs, the grid is interactive immediately, all thumbnails land, re-dropping completes in seconds via the hash short-circuit, and the grid page loads under 80 ms warm. The 'all thumbnails land' clause is later reversed by on-demand rendering."}], "edges": [{"source": "plans_2026_09_05_phase_1_remaining_slices_doc", "target": "plans_2026_09_05_phase_1_remaining_slices_usable_at_slice_5", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/superpowers/plans/2026-09-05-phase-1-remaining-slices.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "plans_2026_09_05_phase_1_remaining_slices_doc", "target": "plans_2026_09_05_phase_1_remaining_slices_phase_1_exit_criterion", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/superpowers/plans/2026-09-05-phase-1-remaining-slices.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "plans_2026_09_05_phase_1_remaining_slices_doc", "target": "plans_2026_09_05_phase_1_slice_4_derivatives_derive_on_demand", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/superpowers/plans/2026-09-05-phase-1-remaining-slices.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "plans_2026_09_05_phase_1_remaining_slices_doc", "target": "plans_2026_09_05_phase_1_slice_4_derivatives_last_accessed_at", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/superpowers/plans/2026-09-05-phase-1-remaining-slices.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "plans_2026_09_05_phase_1_remaining_slices_doc", "target": "plans_2026_09_05_phase_1_slice_5_browser_download_route", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/superpowers/plans/2026-09-05-phase-1-remaining-slices.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "plans_2026_09_05_phase_1_remaining_slices_doc", "target": "plans_2026_09_05_phase_1_slice_5_browser_storage_visibility", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/superpowers/plans/2026-09-05-phase-1-remaining-slices.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "plans_2026_09_05_phase_1_remaining_slices_cold_tier_deferred", "target": "plans_2026_09_04_phase_1_slice_3b_3mf_compression", "relation": "conceptually_related_to", "confidence": "INFERRED", "confidence_score": 0.85, "source_file": "docs/superpowers/plans/2026-09-05-phase-1-remaining-slices.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "plans_2026_09_05_phase_1_remaining_slices_doc", "target": "plans_2026_09_04_phase_1_slice_3b_handoff_resource_ceilings", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/superpowers/plans/2026-09-05-phase-1-remaining-slices.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}], "hyperedges": []}